	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0301_shirona_first_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>サザナミわん　には
かいていいせきが　あるでしょ▼
それで　しりあいの　べっそうを
つかわせて　もらっているの▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-02-10T09:09:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>サザナミタ湾　には
海底遺跡が　あるでしょ▼
それで　知り合いの　別荘を
使わせて　もらっているの▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-02-10T09:09:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀：シロナ初回イベント
・横を向いてメッセージ表示
・続けてshirona_first_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SHIRONA
シロナ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0301_shirona_first_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さて　ポケモントレーナーどうし
ふかく　しりあうために▼
おたがいの　ポケモンを
てあわせ　させたいのだけど……▽
おあいて　してくださるかしら？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さて　ポケモントレーナーどうし
深く　知り合うために▼
お互いの　ポケモンを
手合わせ　させたいのだけど……▽
お相手して　くださるかしら？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀：シロナ初回イベント
・主人公と向き合いメッセージ表示
・はい/いいえ
　はい→shirona_first_05
　いいえ→shirona_first_06</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SHIRONA
シロナ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0301_shirona_first_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンを　くりだす　まえから
あたしの　むねが　たかなる……▼
ボールの　なかの　ポケモンたちの
うれしそうな　かんじ　つたわってくる▼
あなた　なにもの　かしら？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンを　繰りだす　前から
あたしの　胸が　高鳴る……▼
ボールの　中の　ポケモンたちの
うれしそうな　感じ　伝わってくる▼
あなた　何者かしら？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀：シロナ初回イベント
・はい選択時
　メッセージ後、トレーナー戦闘に
　dpchampion_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SHIRONA
シロナ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0301_shirona_first_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うふふ
れいせいな　はんだん……　ね▼
じゅんびが　できたら
はなしかけてくれると　うれしいな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>うふふ
冷静な　判断……　ね▼
準備が　できたら
話しかけてくれると　うれしいな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀：シロナ初回イベント
・いいえ選択時</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SHIRONA
シロナ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0301_shirona_first_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シロナ『あら？
じゅんびは　できたの▼
おたがいの　ポケモンを
てあわせ　させたいのだけど……▽
おあいて　してくださるかしら？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>シロナ『あら？
準備は　できたの？▼
お互いの　ポケモンを
手合わせ　させたいのだけど……▽
お相手して　くださるかしら？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀：シロナ初回イベント
・shirona_first_06表示後に再度会話
・はい/いいえ
　はい→shirona_first_01
　いいえ→shirona_first_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SHIRONA
シロナ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:42" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
