	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0301_bigfour1_spring_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シキミ『……やぶれたせかい
そこに　ただ１ぴきで　いた　ポケモン▽
なんて　げんそうてきな　こうけい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>シキミ『……破れた世界
そこに　ただ１匹で　いた　ポケモン▽
なんて　幻想的な　光景！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
