			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0301_swleader2_summer_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ホミカ『つよい　トレーナーになりたい
もっと　ベースが　うまくなりたい▼
どっちも　じつげん　させるから
２ばい　おいしい　じんせい　だよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T07:36:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ホミカ『強い　トレーナーになりたい
もっと　ベースが　巧くなりたい▼
どっちも　実現させるから
２倍　おいしい　人生だよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T07:37:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
