		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0301_swleader2_summer_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ホミカ『ベースを　ひくのは
ゆびでも　ピックでも　いいけど▽
すきなほうが　たのしーでしょ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T09:52:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ホミカ『ベースを　弾くのは
ゆびでも　ピックでも　いいけど▽
好きなほうが　楽しーでしょ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
