			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0301_leader6_summer_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フウロ『カミツレちゃんとは
なかよし　だけど▽
ポケモンしょうぶは　べつよ！▼
だいじなのは　やっぱり
でんき　たいさく　なの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フウロ『カミツレちゃんとは
仲良しだけど▽
ポケモン勝負は　別よ！▼
大事なのは　やっぱり　電気対策なの！
お肌の　ケアぐらい　大事なの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T09:53:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・ランダムメッセージその１
・その日固定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>LEADER6
フウロ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0301_leader6_summer_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フウロ『あれる　あめの　なか
あまぐもを　つきぬけたときに▽
はじめて　みえる　こうけい……▼
いつか　アナタにも　みせてあげたいな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フウロ『荒れる　雨の中
雨雲を　つきぬけたときに▽
はじめて　みえる　光景……▼
いつか　アナタにも　みせてあげたいな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・ランダムメッセージその２
・その日固定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>LEADER6
フウロ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0301_leader6_summer_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フウロ『……いま　かんがえていたの▼
みずぎって　みせるもの　なの？
それとも　かくすもの　なの？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フウロ『……いま　考えていたの▼
水着って　魅せるもの　なの？
それとも　隠すもの　なの？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
