				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>LEADER6
フウロ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0301_leader6_summer_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フウロ『はるか　とおくの　シンオウも
ひこうきを　つかえば　ひとっとび！▼
アタシは　ポケモンの　そらをとぶも
きもちよくて　だいすき　だけど</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T06:09:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フウロ『はるか　遠くの　シンオウも
飛行機を　使えば　ひとっとび！▼
アタシは　ポケモンの　そらをとぶも
気持ちよくて　大好き　だけど</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T06:09:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
