	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0301_leader4_summer_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>カミツレ『……ポケモンの　みりょくを
ひきだすには　ひきだす　がわにも▽
みりょくが　ないと　むずかしいわね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>カミツレ『……ポケモンの　魅力を
ひきだすには　ひきだす側にも▽
魅力が　ないと　難しいわね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
