	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0301_leader4_summer_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>カミツレ『なやんでばかりは
からだと　こころに　よくないの▼
そんなときは　しこうかいろを
わざと　ショートさせて▽
きぶんを　いっしん　させないと</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>カミツレ『悩んでばかりは
肉体と　精神に　よくないの▼
そんなときは　思考回路を
わざと　ショートさせて▽
気分を　一新させないと</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T11:31:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
